Scope: this proves physical identity and a partial bounded Message/inventory audit. It checks typed SCHEDULED timeline/expiry indexes, reports conservative status dispositions, verifies Message and terminal-summary Attempt forward references, detects unreferenced recognized INFLIGHT Attempt ledgers, and checks Claim identity against current Message and Store incarnation. It does not compare complete current Message and Terminal summary state/ref sets, prove live Owner lease/policy/Claim precondition authority, close Admission/Journal or other owner/proof relationships, validate old TimelineEntry/Profile semantics, terminal/Floor owners or Lane control, replay source bytes after the checkpoint, produce the full per-Shard dry-run report, establish durable migration activation, convert a Store, or authorize rollback/reader retirement. B6 remains `IN_PROGRESS / PENDING_CENTRAL_VALIDATION`.
